WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:12.400
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.900
Open the task that has to wait

3
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.700
Tap Edit

4
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:24.800
Pull the form up to Depends On

5
00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.300
Under Depends On, tap Add

6
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.900
Tick the task it waits for

7
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:35.400
Done

8
00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.900
Save

9
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.400
The task shows what it's waiting on

10
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.900
Open the Gantt

11
00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:48.500
Month fits both tasks on the screen

12
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:58.900
An arrow runs from the task it waits for
